      "mergedPostDetails": "Ok so, in my avatar, I use glasses that I can move around in different positions and drop in to the world, for some reason now whenever I enable \"Freeze To World\" on the constraint, It comes back to the first target and then It freezes instead of getting freeze in place. This setup used to work before this patch, and I've tried updating the avatar but It still happening, I guess I need to change the way I do the animation in the mean time. . .",
